    {
      "beat_id": "BIDEA",
      "act": "THE IDEA",
      "lane": "IDEA",
      "narration_text": "Here's the idea of this film. When a fix from Claude passes the tests but you can tell it drifted, the move isn't to type fix it again. Every follow-up types on top of the wrong answer, and the context pushes Claude toward variations on what already passed — not toward the answer that was never tried. Rewind to the checkpoint. Start a fresh session. And respecify the ask with the failure mode named as a constraint. Same model. Different context. First try, right.",
      "estimated_duration_s": 29.9,
      "voice": "am_onyx",
      "engine": "kokoro",
      "voice_kokoro": "am_onyx",
